OL,3,GNEWSA'This is not just a shopping
OL,4,Acentre - it's a community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness owners and shoppers in
OL,7,FWakefield say they are breathing a sigh
OL,8,Fof relief, as plans to demolish The
OL,9,FRidings centre look set to be scrapped.
OL,10,FBut will a new idea to revive the 1980s
OL,11,FAmerican-style mall be money well
OL,12,Fspent?
OL,14,F"I'm absolutely overjoyed," says Amanda
OL,15,FCondones, who runs a women's boutique.
OL,17,F"It's not just a shopping centre, it's
OL,18,Falso a community where people come.
OL,19,FIt's used for a lot of social events."
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
