OL,4,Acentre - it's a community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCondones opened her first shop in the
OL,7,Fcity in 2013 and moved to the centre a
OL,8,Fcouple of years ago, hoping it would
OL,9,Fhelp her attract more business.
